{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1398305-let-s-make-a-beast-together","id":1398305,"title":"Let's Make a Beast Together!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-23T01:10:20-07:00","id":1398305,"title":"Let's Make a Beast Together!","content":"I was inspired by another Sites Forum, where somebody has a game where people make dragons together. I thought it would be fun to do the same here <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here's how we'll go about making Beasts.<br /> <b>Step 1- </b>The first person will choose the Beasts Family. (in this case that'll be me)<br /> <b>Step 2- </b>The second person will then choose their Hunger.<br /> <b>Step 3- </b>The Next person will choose the Beasts Life and Legend.<br /> <b>Step 4- </b>The person after that will Distribute their Attributes.<br /> <b>Step 5- </b>The following person will then give them their Skills.<br /> <b>Step 6- </b>Another person will give them their Merits.<br /> <b>Step 7- </b>This person will choose the Beast's Atavisms<br /> <b>Step 8- </b>This next player will choose the Beast's Nightmares<br /> <b>Step 9- </b>This person will bring the Lair Traits.<br /> <b>Step 10- </b>This player will name the beast and give them a description.<br /> <br /> Sorry for all these steps but I hope that this will be fun.<br /> For the person who finishes making the beast the cycle will go back to step one and they can choose the family.<br /> And please repeat everything that has been added so far in your post, it makes it easier for the next person to see the stats and such for the beast.<br /> <br /> Anyway, Let us being. ^^<br /> <br /> <b>Family- </b>Eshmaki <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25898-rockclanhawkstar","name":"Rockclanhawkstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25898_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T03:07:24-07:00","id":1398317,"title":"","content":"This seems pretty interesting!<br /> <br /> <b>Hunger- </b>Hunger for Ruin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25438-justasplanned","name":"JustAsPlanned","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T10:58:47-07:00","id":1398387,"title":"","content":"Hummm<br /> Life:Politician<br /> Legend: Devourer","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 06-23-2020, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T12:20:47-07:00","id":1398403,"title":"","content":"Resolve and Int: 3 Wit 2<br /> Composure: 3, Presence and manipulation 2<br /> Str,Dex,Sta:2","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T13:10:50-07:00","id":1398417,"title":"","content":"Mental Skills: Academics 2, Investigation 2, Occult 1, Politics 2(Local Politics)<br /> Physical Skills: Larceny 2, Stealth 2<br /> Social Skills: Animal Ken 1, Empathy 2(Sense Motive), Intimidation 2, Socialize 2, Streetwise 1, Subterfuge 3(Kind Fa\u00e7ade)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13710-da13thhellblazer","name":"Da13thHellblazer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-23T13:15:38-07:00","id":1398418,"title":"","content":"I feel like Merits should come second-to-last, considering the broad nature of prerequisites and the normal character creation step-order.<br /> <br /> Academics 2, Investigation 3, Occult 1 [free dot], Politics 2<br /> Empathy 1, Expression 2, Persuasion 2, Socialize 2, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge 2<br /> Athletics 1, Brawl 1, Larceny 1, Stealth 1","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T09:59:25-07:00","id":1399612,"title":"","content":"Lair: 3.<br /> Lair Traits: Minions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T19:19:45-07:00","id":1399975,"title":"","content":"So, it seems like we have two skill sets as well as some early lair dots. Any preferences on which we go with?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25438-justasplanned","name":"JustAsPlanned","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T12:03:03-07:00","id":1400151,"title":"","content":"Huh whoops, I'd say that the who submitted the skills first we go with and. For the Lair, we can just kind of go with it. But it only become valid when we actually reach the Lair steps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25898-rockclanhawkstar","name":"Rockclanhawkstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25898_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T15:12:54-07:00","id":1400190,"title":"","content":"That seems fair. Anyhow, so far we have:<br /> <br /> <b>Family: </b>Eshmaki<br /> <b>Hunger: </b>Ravager<br /> <b>Life: </b>Politician<br /> <b>Legend: </b>Devourer<br /> <b>Mental Attributes: </b>Resolve 3, Intelligence 3, Wits 2<br /> <b>Social Attributes: </b>Composure 3, Presence 2, Manipulation 2<br /> <b>Physical Attributes: </b>Strength 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 2<br /> <b>Mental Skills: </b>Academics 2, Investigation 3, Occult 1*, Politics 2 (Local Politics)<br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Larceny 2, Stealth 2<br /> <b>Social Skills:</b> Animal Ken 1, Empathy 2 (Sense Motive), Intimidation 2, Socialize 2, Streetwise 1, Subterfuge 3 (Kind Fa\u00e7ade)<br /> <b>Lair: </b>3<br /> <b>Lair Traits:</b> Minions<br /> <br /> *The first Occult dot being free bcus Beast.<br /> <br /> So far our Beast seems pretty nasty. Given the political stuff, the desire to ruin combined with being an Eshmaki, and having minions in their Lair, I could see them as being something of a hidden Puppetmaster. Pulling the strings from the shadows, that kinda thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25438,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25438-justasplanned","user":"JustAsPlanned","date":". 07-11-2020, 06:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25438-justasplanned","name":"JustAsPlanned","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T03:17:05-07:00","id":1402217,"title":"","content":"If I am correct, it is time to give them their Atavisms now?<br /> In which case;<br /> <br /> <b>Family: </b>Eshmaki<br /> <b>Hunger: </b>Ravager<br /> <b>Life: </b>Politician<br /> <b>Legend: </b>Devourer<br /> <b>Mental Attributes: </b>Resolve 3, Intelligence 3, Wits 2<br /> <b>Social Attributes: </b>Composure 3, Presence 2, Manipulation 2<br /> <b>Physical Attributes: </b>Strength 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 2<br /> <b>Mental Skills: </b>Academics 2, Investigation 2, Occult 1*, Politics 2 (Local Politics)<br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Larceny 2, Stealth 2<br /> <b>Social Skills:</b> Animal Ken 1, Empathy 2 (Sense Motive), Intimidation 2, Socialize 2, Streetwise 1, Subterfuge 3 (Kind Fa\u00e7ade)<br /> <b>Lair: </b>3<br /> <b>Lair Traits:</b> Minions?<br /> <b>Atavisms</b>: Alien Mindset (from the Player's Guide), From the Shadows<br /> <br /> May I ask which Birthright our creation will have? Since it can't use the one in the corebook effectively (no brawl or weaponry)...<br /> <br /> Edit: Hold on, we are a skill dot short in the Mental category. 7 base (for secondary skill category) + 1 Occult for being a Beast","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 07-11-2020, 06:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T03:42:15-07:00","id":1402220,"title":"","content":"Oops! Yeah I meant Investigation 3, that was an error on my part. And as for Birthright... maybe this one from the Player\u2019s Guide?<br /> <br /> \u201dThe Eshmaki enflames her victims\u2019 terror with shadowy phantasms sculpted from darkness. Once per chapter, the Lurker can sculpt puppets of shadow and infuse them with her Horror\u2019s malevolence. Roll Manipulation + Expression \u2013 Composure. On a success, the victim suf- fers the Shaken Condition. On an exceptional success the victim also suffers the Frightened Condition. On a dramatic failure, the Beast gains the Shaken Condition as the rebuffed Horror turns its rage against her.\u201c","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25438-justasplanned","name":"JustAsPlanned","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-11T07:29:42-07:00","id":1402243,"title":"","content":"So...roll a chance die to give someone the Shaken condition? Well I agree that the thematical element of the birthright works really well for our concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-13T09:44:17-07:00","id":1402613,"title":"","content":"Maybe Thralls as its second Lair Trait? Really make its Lair infested with horrifying lesser monstrosities?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}